  unitName: Catoblepas
  unitId: 40262
  unitNumber: 636
  description: A highly poisonous and frightening beast. The giant eye it has on
    its face makes its head heavy, making it always seem like it is bowing its head
    as it walks around. The vision of this eye is apparently quite poor, leaving
    it unable to spot any enemies until they are in its near proximity. However,
    the threat this demon poses is in the extremely strong poison it carries in its
    body, which is released through its eye. As to whether the poison is released
    in a liquid, solid, or gas form, that still remains unclear. It is said that
    countless people have lost their lives trying to research this toxin.
  summonDesc: Su...Summon...er<br>Cluck, cluck!<br>I...I'll...go...with...you...
  fusionDesc: Be...come...stro...ng...<br>Cluck, cluck!<br>Stron...ger... Cluck!
  evoDesc: Cluck! Cluck!<br>I am...Catoble...pas...<br>Cluck!
